WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.896
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.166 --> 00:02.209
Brother.

3
00:02.209 --> 00:03.466
Big Brother.

4
00:05.333 --> 00:07.274
Can you hear me?

5
00:07.274 --> 00:09.275
Brother... Brother...

6
00:09.275 --> 00:10.483
Can you hear me?

7
00:10.483 --> 00:11.733
It's me, Lin Zai.

8
00:11.733 --> 00:13.158
Brother.

9
00:27.983 --> 00:29.950
What the hell did you do?

10
00:31.042 --> 00:33.882
- This can't be happening. - What the hell did you do?

11
00:34.542 --> 00:36.367
I don't know.

12
00:38.440 --> 00:40.031
Get out.

13
00:41.833 --> 00:43.400
Get the fuck out!

14
00:43.400 --> 00:44.971
Get out!

15
00:54.708 --> 00:57.549
Lin Zai, are you okay?

16
01:00.525 --> 01:03.950
Get out. Leave me alone.

17
01:10.375 --> 01:12.383
I'll be right outside.

18
01:36.875 --> 01:38.883
It's all my fault.

19
01:39.583 --> 01:41.925
I've failed you again.

20
02:22.625 --> 02:24.208
It's all ruined now.

21
02:24.208 --> 02:27.155
This won't work with Lin Zai.

22
02:27.155 --> 02:29.832
No. I can't give up.

23
02:31.083 --> 02:32.883
There's another way.

24
03:37.748 --> 03:42.462
[Apocalypse Log 22]

25
04:08.359 --> 04:10.442
It's me, He Yao.

26
04:10.442 --> 04:12.436
About what you asked me before,

27
04:12.436 --> 04:14.159
I've made up my mind.

28
04:15.200 --> 04:16.583
My token of sincerity...

29
04:16.583 --> 04:19.091
is the immune body you've been seeking.

30
04:20.583 --> 04:21.983
The conditions are simple.

31
04:21.983 --> 04:24.067
I can tell you where he is.

32
04:24.067 --> 04:25.358
But after you take him,

33
04:25.358 --> 04:28.617
I'll be in full charge of his research.

34
04:29.983 --> 04:31.375
Deal.

35
04:31.375 --> 04:33.563
200 kilometers northeast of Green Island Airport,

36
04:33.563 --> 04:35.608
there's an abandoned film studio.

37
04:35.608 --> 04:37.742
How long until your men arrive?

38
04:40.150 --> 04:41.583
Good.

39
04:41.583 --> 04:44.050
I'll be waiting for the good news.

40
04:58.375 --> 05:01.455
He Yao! He Yao, come out!

41
05:01.455 --> 05:02.667
He Yao!

42
05:02.667 --> 05:04.417
He Yao, come out!

43
05:04.417 --> 05:06.292
He Yao!

44
05:06.292 --> 05:08.784
He Yao, come out!

45
05:53.150 --> 05:54.783
Lin Zai.

46
05:57.016 --> 05:58.622
Lie.

47
06:00.567 --> 06:03.075
I just had a nightmare.

48
06:04.369 --> 06:06.417
I dreamed that...

49
06:06.417 --> 06:08.991
my brother had my bone marrow transplant,

50
06:08.991 --> 06:10.875
and then...

51
06:14.650 --> 06:15.692
Where's my brother?

52
06:15.692 --> 06:17.063
Where is my brother?

53
06:17.063 --> 06:19.257
That dream wasn't real, was it?

54
06:19.257 --> 06:20.425
I'm going to find him.

55
06:20.425 --> 06:22.267
Lin Zai, listen to me.

56
06:28.750 --> 06:30.846
Your brother...

57
06:30.846 --> 06:33.063
I've already buried him.

58
06:36.192 --> 06:38.408
B-Buried?

59
06:42.067 --> 06:43.575
Where?

60
06:47.192 --> 06:49.242
I'll take you there.

61
07:07.067 --> 07:08.317
Brother.

62
07:08.317 --> 07:10.450
What's going on outside?

63
07:12.417 --> 07:14.447
Nothing.

64
07:14.447 --> 07:16.991
Just a minor accident in the lab.

65
07:16.991 --> 07:19.917
I know you're worried about the immune body.

66
07:19.917 --> 07:21.592
It's not him.

67
07:22.833 --> 07:25.025
You've misunderstood me.

68
07:25.025 --> 07:27.033
I'm worried about you.

69
07:35.025 --> 07:39.958
Lately, I've been conscious for shorter bouts.

70
07:39.958 --> 07:44.705
I want to use this limited time to have a good talk.

71
08:01.201 --> 08:02.793
Okay.

72
08:13.208 --> 08:15.025
Brother.

73
08:15.025 --> 08:17.617
Can you get me another glass of water?

74
08:20.000 --> 08:22.883
Wanna drink some water?

75
09:45.775 --> 09:47.367
Brother.

76
09:48.942 --> 09:50.950
These past few days,

77
09:51.708 --> 09:55.258
I keep thinking about our school days.

78
09:57.275 --> 10:02.333
We would argue all night over a single problem.

79
10:02.333 --> 10:06.208
The next day, you'd buy breakfast

80
10:06.208 --> 10:08.425
and leave it on my desk.

81
10:10.150 --> 10:14.817
Back then, I always felt only by beating you

82
10:14.817 --> 10:17.033
would my life be worthwhile.

83
10:19.667 --> 10:21.676
Thinking back now,

84
10:22.832 --> 10:24.549
it was so silly.

85
10:26.358 --> 10:30.533
We wasted so much time competing with each other.

86
10:31.942 --> 10:34.408
It wasn't until the world fell apart

87
10:36.208 --> 10:38.883
that we truly faced each other.

88
10:39.730 --> 10:41.571
I'm not willing to accept this either.

89
10:42.983 --> 10:44.617
Truly.

90
10:45.958 --> 10:48.508
I don't want things to end like this.

91
10:55.542 --> 10:57.134
Chang Huan.

92
11:01.650 --> 11:03.450
I know.

93
11:04.792 --> 11:06.926
I can't stop you anymore.

94
11:08.817 --> 11:14.450
But how can I bear to let you walk this path alone?

95
11:16.500 --> 11:18.258
If it's a mistake,

96
11:19.257 --> 11:21.515
I'll make it with you.

97
11:25.733 --> 11:27.783
You don't blame me,

98
11:29.025 --> 11:30.950
nor resent me.

99
11:38.167 --> 11:42.500
Others may have a hundred thousand reasons to hate you,

100
11:42.500 --> 11:44.092
and resent you,

101
11:45.625 --> 11:47.841
but I never will.

102
11:48.525 --> 11:51.783
I will never be your enemy.

103
11:52.500 --> 11:57.283
I am your accomplice.

104
13:24.792 --> 13:26.092
Brother.

105
13:26.775 --> 13:28.617
I'm sorry.

106
14:45.125 --> 14:48.216
Be good and go back.

107
14:53.771 --> 14:56.905
Lin Zai, the dead cannot be brought back.

108
15:01.417 --> 15:05.342
I... I watched my brother die with the zombies

109
15:07.150 --> 15:09.658
just to protect me.

110
15:11.983 --> 15:14.950
I couldn't do anything back then.

111
15:17.983 --> 15:20.617
And now, seeing him like this before me...

112
15:23.400 --> 15:27.408
What value do I have as an "immune body"?

113
15:30.417 --> 15:33.967
I can't even keep the person who matters most to me.

114
15:40.458 --> 15:42.346
Lie.

115
15:42.346 --> 15:44.021
Just go.

116
15:44.650 --> 15:46.617
Leave me alone.

117
15:47.292 --> 15:50.204
He Yao's experiment has proven

118
15:50.204 --> 15:52.838
that being an "immune body" is bullshit.

119
15:54.250 --> 15:56.883
Why are you still guarding me?

120
15:57.991 --> 15:59.583
No.

121
16:01.708 --> 16:04.299
- It must be He Yao... - Enough!

122
16:06.208 --> 16:08.800
I don't want to hear any of this.

123
16:12.858 --> 16:14.658
Just leave.

124
16:15.275 --> 16:17.325
I'm begging you.

125
17:01.150 --> 17:03.200
What reason do I have left

126
17:04.167 --> 17:06.051
to keep living?

127
17:34.483 --> 17:35.650
Lin Zai.

128
17:35.650 --> 17:37.325
You're awake.

129
19:03.667 --> 19:05.259
What are you thinking about?

130
19:07.275 --> 19:08.867
Brother.

131
19:09.917 --> 19:14.509
What do you think we'll be like in our next lives?

132
19:22.208 --> 19:23.800
In our next lives,

133
19:25.096 --> 19:27.771
I hope we meet as strangers.

134
19:29.983 --> 19:34.825
Then you'll be the top student,

135
19:36.250 --> 19:40.658
always leading the way, shining brightly.

136
19:46.583 --> 19:49.050
Are you afraid I won't recognize you?

137
19:50.650 --> 19:53.367
I'll work hard so that you'll notice me.

138
19:58.583 --> 20:00.508
I'll definitely recognize you.

139
20:01.167 --> 20:06.258
In this world, no one knows you better than I do.

140
20:07.384 --> 20:09.425
When you find an article you like,

141
20:09.425 --> 20:12.300
you fold the corner and read it repeatedly.

142
20:12.300 --> 20:14.800
When you're in a good mood,

143
20:14.800 --> 20:17.550
you fold paper frogs with a ruler.

144
20:17.550 --> 20:19.467
When you're in a bad mood,

145
20:19.467 --> 20:22.142
you go and water the cactus.

146
20:22.958 --> 20:27.013
You like durian, and you hate spinach.

147
20:29.667 --> 20:33.884
I remember every side of you clearly.

148
20:36.208 --> 20:37.842
Chang Huan.

149
20:39.009 --> 20:41.425
This life is still long.

150
20:41.425 --> 20:46.017
Things will get better for us.

151
21:03.125 --> 21:04.717
What's wrong?

152
21:09.134 --> 21:12.309
Don't worry. I'll go check it out.

153
21:46.092 --> 21:48.675
Because I saw it with my own eyes.

154
21:48.675 --> 21:52.809
My brother slowly calmed down from his manic state.

155
21:53.708 --> 21:55.550
Fuck.

156
22:03.550 --> 22:05.710
You actually used Lin Zai's brother as a front,

157
22:05.710 --> 22:08.695
tricking him into cooperating with your bullshit experiments.

158
22:08.695 --> 22:11.225
This is a fucking sedative!

159
22:15.750 --> 22:17.259
Yes.

160
22:17.259 --> 22:18.800
I did lie to him.

161
22:18.800 --> 22:20.842
But Lin Xian was beyond saving long ago.

162
22:20.842 --> 22:22.375
If it weren't for my ruse,

163
22:22.375 --> 22:24.625
Lin Zai wouldn't even have this last bit of hope.

164
22:24.625 --> 22:26.333
I gave him something to live for,

165
22:26.333 --> 22:27.804
even if that hope was a lie.

166
22:27.804 --> 22:30.140
You fucking call that hope?

167
22:30.140 --> 22:31.750
Without you messing things up,

168
22:31.750 --> 22:33.716
he would have been just fine.

169
22:36.829 --> 22:38.675
Lie.

170
22:38.675 --> 22:41.300
Do you really understand Lin Zai?

171
22:41.300 --> 22:44.092
Just because someone smiles in a crowd,

172
22:44.092 --> 22:46.684
does it really mean they're happy?

173
22:47.592 --> 22:50.634
What the hell are you talking about?

174
22:50.634 --> 22:52.717
Can't you see?

175
22:52.717 --> 22:55.750
After his family members left one by one,

176
22:55.750 --> 22:58.083
Lin Zai has been living like an empty shell.

177
22:58.083 --> 22:59.606
At least my experiments

178
22:59.606 --> 23:02.258
made him feel like he's still useful.

179
23:06.717 --> 23:10.458
But Lin Zai thinks he's the one who killed his brother.

180
23:10.458 --> 23:11.583
Fine.

181
23:11.583 --> 23:13.512
Then go tell him the truth right now.

182
23:13.512 --> 23:15.641
Go tell him, "Lin Zai, wake up."

183
23:15.641 --> 23:17.413
"Your brother was beyond saving long ago."

184
23:17.413 --> 23:19.092
"Everything you did was in vain."

185
23:19.092 --> 23:21.267
"You were just being played by He Yao."

186
23:30.583 --> 23:32.634
Lie.

187
23:32.634 --> 23:34.800
Let me ask you this.

188
23:34.800 --> 23:37.509
Do you want to save him?

189
23:37.509 --> 23:41.850
Or do you want to snuff out his last breath yourself?

190
23:54.592 --> 23:58.692
At least, until I find the real answer,

191
23:58.692 --> 24:02.873
my deception gives him a reason to hold on.

192
24:02.873 --> 24:04.550
If you expose the truth now,

193
24:04.550 --> 24:07.309
it's like pulling out his last bit of life.

194
24:11.958 --> 24:13.752
Shut up!

195
24:13.752 --> 24:16.427
Stop talking your bullshit.

196
24:20.925 --> 24:23.934
Lin Zai can decide what to do with you.

197
24:35.717 --> 24:38.375
Can't you see?

198
24:38.375 --> 24:40.791
After losing his family one by one,

199
24:40.791 --> 24:43.300
175 Lin Zai has been living like an empty shell.

200
24:45.224 --> 24:49.418
At least, until I find the real answer,

201
24:49.418 --> 24:53.884
my deception gives him a reason to hold on.
